      "source_number": "177",
      "independent_solution": "Panel (a): from (0,0) and (2,1), slope 1/2, boundary y=x/2; hatch above gives y>=x/2, including the solid line. (-2,-1) corroborates the slope. Panel (b): from (0,-1) and (1,1), slope 2, boundary y=2x-1; hatch right/below gives y<=2x-1, including the solid line. (1,0) is hatched and satisfies 0<=1 whereas (0,0) is not hatched and fails 0<=-1. Each grid cell is 1/2 unit, inferred from the labelled unit spacing; dashed guides do not make either inequality strict.",
